Sweet and Lowdown is a comedy, drama, music film directed by Woody Allen.

2
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:46,000
In the 1930s, jazz guitarist Emmet Ray idolizes Django Reinhardt,
faces gangsters and falls in love with a mute woman.

